  "content": "\n\n<h1>扩展光标</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/default.png\" alt=\"默认\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/pointing_hand.png\" alt=\"指针\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/grabbing.png\" alt=\"抓取\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/ibeam.png\" alt=\"文本输入\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/shift.png\" alt=\"Shift\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/busy.gif\" alt=\"忙碌\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/not_allowed.png\" alt=\"禁止\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/crosshair.png\" alt=\"十字准星\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_all.png\" alt=\"全向缩放\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ew.png\" alt=\"水平缩放\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ns.png\" alt=\"垂直缩放\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nwse.png\" alt=\"对角线缩放(左上至右下)\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nesw.png\" alt=\"对角线缩放(右上至左下)\"></p>\n<p>用具有 Minecraft 主题风格的光标替换了原本枯燥的默认系统光标。</p>\n<p>在 1.21.9 版本为该模组带来大量不兼容更新之前，它曾名为 <a href=\"https://github.com/fishstiz/minecraft-cursor/blob/master/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Cursor</a>。</p>\n<h2>📌 依赖要求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fabric 平台：Fabric API</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>✨ 功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用资源包自定义光标纹理。</li>\n<li>通过自定义动画让光标更加生动。</li>\n<li>包含适用于其他场景的额外光标形状。</li>\n<li>通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fminecraft-cursor-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fgetting-started%2523all-cursors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>传统模式</strong></a> 为各类 GUI 元素增强光标逻辑。</li>\n<li>按需调整各项选项。前往模组界面，或依次点击 设置 › 控制设置 › 鼠标设置 › 光标设置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1338/150/cursors_extended-gif.gif\" alt=\"扩展光标\"></p>\n<h2>🖌️ 创建资源包</h2>\n<p>制作专属资源包，分享至支持的平台，并在此获得展示 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fshowcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fshowcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishstiz/resources/refs/heads/main/cursors-extended/showcase.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"展示\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bedrock-style-cursors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dUA5FyFq/images/28f9504fa044c59491a1555494b3e579eec186a1.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"基岩风格光标\">\n</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>已为 Minecraft Cursor v3 制作过资源包？使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252ftools%252f%2523v3-converter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>V3 转换器</strong></a> 进行转换。</p>\n<p>快速入门：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fgetting-started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started</a></p>",
